        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-MJRP48-613, Oil Rubbed Bronze 48 Inch Stainless Steel Offset Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oil Rubbed Bronze 48 Inch Offset Pull features a beautiful,  dark brown oil rubbed bronze finish that appears almost black. Its modern styling makes it a great choice for contemporary spaces. The 48 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Stainless Steel Offset Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from mounting kits that allow installation on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-MJRP48-specifications.gif?v=1704354541\" width=\"410\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-MJRP48-613 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-stainless-steel-offset-pull-dwd-mjrp24-613\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/36-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-stainless-steel-offset-pull-dwd-mjrp36-613\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a>, or <a href=\"/products/60-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-stainless-steel-offset-pull-dwd-mjrp60-613\"><b>60\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Contemporary Oil Rubbed Bronze Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: Tubular Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 49-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 48\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3-15/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Handle Dimensions: 1 x 1-1/2 (rectangular)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
